      {
        "action": "replace",
        "decision_id": "D000924",
        "disposition": "existing_equivalent",
        "rationale": "For H=SheafHom_O(A,B), Stacks' equivariant internal-Hom lemma and invariant-direct-image definition give (q_*^G H)(V)=H(q^{-1}V)^G=Hom_{O,G}(q^{-1}V;A,B) for every open V in X/G. This is exactly the corrected formula (5.6.2) and its sectionwise interpretation. No four-functor, Ext, locality, stalk, acyclicity, or spectral-sequence claim is included.",
